  "evidence": "TEXT_E: 20,000 more police, tougher sentencing, more prison places, firm school discipline (Ofsted), voter ID, maintain First Past the Post, defence spending above 2%, keep Trident, Space Command, oppose a second Scottish referendum and strengthen the Union, controlled points‑based immigration prioritising skills/contribution and requiring contribution before benefits, Brexit to take back control of laws/borders, levelling up via Towns Fund/Shared Prosperity Fund, treat EU and non‑EU migrants equally, raise National Living Wage, low/predictable taxes, anti‑avoidance, NHS funding boost and mental health parity, animal welfare and environmental protections (40GW offshore wind, moratorium on fracking unless proven safe). TEXT_C: Halve the prison population, end the war on drugs with legal, regulated supply and health‑led support, dismantle the hostile environment, remain and reform the EU/People’s Vote, devolve power and curb media power, cancel Trident and end arms sales, expansive equality/care agenda (UBI, £12 Living Wage, rent controls, end no‑fault evictions, scrap tuition fees, humane migration, LGBTIQA+ and disability rights), strong environmental/sanctity framing (Clean Air Act, ecocide law, end factory farming, rewilding, no fracking, no new nuclear).",
